[1 Status]  2 Drift   3 Settings   4 Activity

Keyboard

  Tab, Shift-Tab, 1–4: switch tabs
  r: reload status, drift and settings
  s: sync now
  check = looked at the remote; sync = applied changes
  ↑/↓ or k/j: move the selection
  Enter: open drift details; Esc: close them
  Enter: edit a setting, Enter again saves; Esc cancels
  w: save a kept draft; u: confirm removal from config.toml
  Dialogs: Tab/arrows focus; Enter confirms; Esc/outside click cancels
  ←/→/Space or click while editing: choose; Custom/Other: type
  a on Settings: expand or collapse Advanced
  f: follow new activity; ↑/↓, PgUp/PgDn: scroll
  Mouse: click a tab or row, click a target again for details; wheel: scroll
  ?: show or hide this help
  q or Ctrl-C: quit




? help · a advanced · q quit · mouse: click, wheel
